This file credits third-party work used by this repository. Details per
reference are in doc/references.md. Entries are added by the slice that
first uses a reference.

No third-party source code is ported into this repository so far.

* cmark (https://github.com/commonmark/cmark), BSD-2-Clause, copyright
  John MacFarlane and contributors. Dev-only oracle: `tools/oracle/commonmark-own`
  runs it over inputs written in this repository to generate the
  `tests/pairs/markdown/own/*.expected` files (its HTML output). Its
  behaviour was also studied for ATX and setext headings; no code was copied.

* cmark-gfm (https://github.com/github/cmark-gfm), BSD-2-Clause, copyright
  GitHub, Inc., John MacFarlane and contributors. Dev-only oracle for the
  `gfm-*` inputs under `tests/pairs/markdown/own/` (strikethrough). No code
  copied. The inline emphasis algorithm was studied in commonmark.js
  (BSD-2-Clause) and markdown-it (MIT); no code copied.

* plenary.nvim (https://github.com/nvim-lua/plenary.nvim), MIT. Test runner
  only; fetched into the gitignored `deps/` by `make deps`, never vendored.
